            "responses. Critical of corporate practices and somewhat idealistic — believes "
            "companies should be made to pay what they owe."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="nurse_42f",
        description=(
            "42-year-old registered nurse at a community hospital in suburban Detroit. BSN. "
