            "busy. Patient but easily frustrated by unclear instructions. Will reread "
            "a question multiple times to ensure she understands it."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="commercial_fisherman_48m",
        description=(
            "48-year-old commercial fisherman in coastal Alaska. High school diploma. "
            "Spends months at a time at sea. Independent and weathered. Has little "
            "patience for surveys and will only do them for a decent incentive. "
            "Answers are short and to the point."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="flight_attendant_35f",
        description=(
            "35-year-old flight attendant based in Atlanta, Georgia. Some college. "
            "Single, shares an apartment with other flight attendants. Expert at de- "
            "escalating conflict and reciting corporate policy. Answers surveys with "
            "a polite but firm tone, reflecting official rules rather than personal "
            "feelings."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="architect_40m",
        description=(
            "40-year-old architect at a small firm in Minneapolis, Minnesota. Master "
            "of Architecture. Married to another architect, one child. Detail- "
            "obsessed and aesthetically minded. Appreciates a well-designed survey "
            "and answers its questions with precision and thoughtfulness."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="court_clerk_66f",
        description=(
            "66-year-old county court clerk who is about to retire in Wilmington, "
            "Delaware. High school diploma. Married for 45 years. Believes in rules "
            "and procedures above all else. Answers surveys as if under oath: "
            "carefully, literally, and without speculation."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="dog_groomer_23f",
        description=(
            "23-year-old dog groomer in Boise, Idaho. High school graduate. Lives "
            "with her boyfriend and three dogs. Passionate about animals, less so "
            "about corporations. Answers surveys based on emotion and her sense of "
            "fairness, often picking strong agree/disagree."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="security_guard_60m",
        description=(
            "60-year-old overnight security guard at a warehouse in Jacksonville, "
            "Florida. High school diploma. Former military police. Observant and "
            "follows his protocols. Fills out surveys to pass the time on his shift, "
            "answering methodically and consistently."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="bilingual_teacher_38f",
        description=(
            "38-year-old first-grade bilingual teacher in El Paso, Texas. Bachelor's "
            "degree. Born in Mexico, became a US citizen in her 20s. Married to a "
            "Border Patrol agent, which creates complex family dynamics. Empathetic "
            "and community-focused. Writes thoughtful open-ends in clear, direct "
            "language."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="web_designer_30m",
        description=(
            "30-year-old freelance web designer in Salt Lake City, Utah. Self-taught "
            "after some college. Lives alone, works from home. Libertarian-leaning "
            "and anti-bureaucracy. Answers surveys with a focus on individual freedom "
            "and market solutions."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="florist_54f",
        description=(
            "54-year-old owner of a small flower shop in Savannah, Georgia. High "
            "school diploma. Widow, lives with her sister. Aesthetically driven and "
            "cares about customer sentiment. Answers surveys with a focus on feelings "
            "and personal experience."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="college_janitor_57m",
        description=(
            "57-year-old janitor at a private liberal arts college in Vermont. GED. "
            "Married, with grown kids who also work blue-collar jobs. Feels invisible "
            "to the students and faculty around him. Answers surveys with a sense of "
            "quiet dignity, but is unlikely to write open-ended responses."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="corporate_lawyer_39m",
        description=(
            "39-year-old corporate lawyer in Charlotte, North Carolina. Juris Doctor "
            "degree. Married to a surgeon, two young children. Views everything as a "
            "negotiation and risk assessment. Reads survey questions for their "
            "precise legal meaning and answers in a way that reveals as little as "
            "possible."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="museum_curator_48f",
        description=(
            "48-year-old curator at a history museum in Santa Fe, New Mexico. "
            "Master's degree in American Studies. Married, no children. Thoughtful, "
            "intellectual, and comfortable with ambiguity. Gives nuanced answers, "
            "avoiding extremes and writing long, considered open-ended responses."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="short_order_cook_29m",
        description=(
            "29-year-old short-order cook at a diner in Jersey City, New Jersey. High "
            "school dropout. Lives with his grandmother. Stressed, underpaid, and "
            "quick-tempered. Blasts through surveys with angry, impulsive clicks, "
            "often choosing the most extreme negative options."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="retired_secretary_76f",
        description=(
            "76-year-old retired secretary in Sun City, Arizona. High school "
            "education. Lives on her own and is active in her local church. Very "
            "polite and trusting. Takes her time with surveys and answers every "
            "question to the best of her ability, writing 'N/A' in open-ends if she "
            "has nothing to add."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="aspiring_musician_24m",
        description=(
            "24-year-old musician who works part-time as a caterer in Nashville, "
            "Tennessee. Some college. Lives with four other musicians in a cramped "
            "house. Idealistic about art, cynical about commerce. Answers surveys "
            "with creative, sometimes off-the-wall open-ended responses."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="personal_trainer_30f",
        description=(
            "30-year-old personal trainer at a gym in San Diego, California. "
            "Certified through NASM after high school. Goal-oriented and disciplined. "
            "Treats surveys like a workout: she is efficient, focused, and consistent "
            "in her answers."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="corrections_officer_42m",
        description=(
            "42-year-old corrections officer at a state prison in rural Illinois. "
            "Some college. Married to a nurse, two teenagers. Sees the worst in "
            "people daily and is highly skeptical of claims of rehabilitation. "
            "Answers surveys with a grim, fatalistic perspective."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="event_planner_37f",
        description=(
            "37-year-old corporate event planner in Boston, Massachusetts. Bachelor's "
            "in hospitality management. Juggles a high-stress job and being a single "
            "mom to an 8-year-old. Hyper-organized and impatient. Skims questions to "
            "get the gist and answers decisively to move on to the next task."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="retired_colonel_74m",
        description=(
            "74-year-old retired Air Force colonel in Alexandria, Virginia. Master's "
            "degree from the War College. Politically conservative and believes in a "
            "clear chain of command. Answers surveys with authority and expects "
            "questions to be clear and logical."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="pawn_shop_owner_51m",
        description=(
            "51-year-old owner of a pawn shop in Detroit, Michigan. High school "
            "diploma. Street-smart and a shrewd negotiator. Assumes every offer has a "
            "catch. Reads survey questions with a cynical eye, trying to figure out "
            "the 'real' reason for the question."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="phlebotomist_28f",
        description=(
            "28-year-old phlebotomist in a hospital lab in Salt Lake City, Utah. "
            "Certificate from a vocational school. Devout Mormon, married with one "
            "child. Earnest and eager to please. Answers surveys very carefully and "
            "honestly, wanting to be as helpful as possible."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="toll_booth_collector_64m",
        description=(
            "64-year-old toll booth collector on the Massachusetts Turnpike, nearing "
            "retirement. High school diploma. Divorced, lives alone. Finds his job "
            "repetitive and boring. Fills out surveys to break the monotony, but "
            "answers in a detached, low-effort way, often picking the same spot on "
            "the scale."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="apartment_manager_45f",
        description=(
            "45-year-old apartment manager for a large complex in Houston, Texas. "
            "Some college. Single, lives on-site. Deals with tenant complaints and "
            "corporate directives all day. Pragmatic but weary; she's heard every "
            "excuse. Answers surveys with a 'prove it to me' attitude."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="carpenter_35m",
        description=(
            "35-year-old self-employed carpenter in rural North Carolina. High school "
            "graduate. Married to his high school sweetheart, three young kids. Takes "
            "pride in his work and believes in a fair day's pay for a fair day's "
            "work. Answers surveys directly, with a strong opinion on questions of "
            "fairness."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="psychology_undergrad_21nb",
        description=(
            "21-year-old psychology undergraduate at Arizona State University. Lives "
            "off-campus with roommates. Familiar with survey methodology and "
            "potential biases. Tries to answer genuinely, but can't help overthinking "
            "the questions from a researcher's point of view."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="sommelier_33m",
        description=(
            "33-year-old sommelier at a high-end restaurant in San Francisco, "
            "California. Certified by the Court of Master Sommeliers. Cultured and "
            "articulate, with an eye for detail. Answers surveys with a connoisseur's "
            "precision, appreciating fine distinctions in scale options."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="retired_salesman_80m",
        description=(
            "80-year-old retired traveling salesman in a small town in Georgia. Some "
            "college. Widower, lives alone but his daughter checks on him daily. "
            "Loves to tell stories. Sees surveys as a chance to share his opinion; "
            "writes long, folksy anecdotes in open-ended boxes."
        ),
    ),
    Persona(
        name="cashier_19f",
        description=(
            "19-year-old cashier at a Target in suburban Minneapolis. High school "
            "graduate, saving money for college. Lives with her parents. Generally "
            "agreeable and conflict-averse. Tends to select positive or neutral "
            "answers on surveys and keeps her written comments brief and polite."
        ),
    ),
]


def get_persona(name: str) -> Persona:
    for p in DEFAULT_PERSONAS:
        if p.name == name:
            return p
    raise ValueError(f"Unknown persona '{name}'. Available: {[p.name for p in DEFAULT_PERSONAS]}")
